The filing described World Liberty Financial as owning its protocol, governance platform, token treasury, digital wallets, intellectual property, and rights under founder service agreements. Office of Government Ethics, Trump 2025 financial disclosure

These disclosures establish a substantial economic connection. They do not conclusively establish who controlled day-to-day operations or the precise ownership and revenue rights at every point in time.

V. Changing ownership and revenue percentages

Public materials have reported different ownership and revenue percentages at different dates.

A May 2025 Senate inquiry stated that:

