ownership through trusts or intermediary entities.

Only executed agreements and verified accounting records can establish the actual economic interest at a given time.

VI. USD1 structure

USD1 was presented as a dollar-pegged stablecoin backed by dollar-denominated reserve assets.

Its economic structure should be established through:

